# Feature PRD Standard

Each feature PRD must include:
1. Problem, Goals, Non-Goals
2. Domain rules / state machines
3. Data (tables/fields)
4. API surface
5. Acceptance criteria (checkboxes)
6. Pointer to UNIT_TEST_CASES section

Do not invent out-of-v1 scope (adaptive, video, SSO, non-PDF) unless Status says Phase 2.

When AC change, update matching UT-* rows in `docs/testing/UNIT_TEST_CASES.md` in the same PR.
